## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Package Installation

#### Frontend (`homezyy`)
```bash
npx expo install expo-notifications expo-device expo-constants
```
These are the official Expo modules. `expo-notifications` handles tokens + listeners, `expo-device` detects physical devices (tokens only work on physical devices), `expo-constants` reads `projectId`.

#### Backend (`FIXI-BACKEND`)
```bash
npm install expo-server-sdk
```
The official Expo server SDK for sending push notifications from Node.js.

