### Phase 4: Backend Push Utility

#### [NEW] [sendPushNotification.js](file:///c:/Users/Sriharish/Desktop/FIXI-BACKEND/FIXI-BACKEND/utils/sendPushNotification.js)
A reusable utility function using `expo-server-sdk`:
```js
sendPushNotification(pushToken, { title, body, data })
```
- Validates the token format with `Expo.isExpoPushToken()`
- Sends a single push message via the Expo Push API
- Logs success/failure using the existing logger
- The `data` field carries the hidden routing payload (e.g., `{ screen: '/wallet', bookingId: '...' }`)

